# The app image (Dockerfile) builds from global.json, the Directory.*.props, src/ and the parts of the
# reference/ submodule that src/Campfire.Assets.Build embeds (app/assets, app/javascript, vendor, public,
# config) plus its hooks/. Everything else stays out of the build context.
*

!/global.json
!/Directory.Build.props
!/Directory.Packages.props
!/src
!/reference/app/assets
!/reference/app/javascript
!/reference/vendor
!/reference/public
!/reference/config
!/reference/hooks

# Build outputs inside what is let in.
**/bin
**/obj
